---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — PrenupAnswers"
  description="PrenupAnswers privacy policy: what we collect (very little), what we don't sell, and your rights under CCPA and GDPR."
>
  <section class="article-head">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Policy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: September 29, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Short version: <strong>we don't sell your data, we don't require an account, and the calculator on this site
      runs entirely in your browser.</strong>
    </p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> aggregated, cookieless traffic statistics (pages visited, referrers, country) via Cloudflare Web Analytics.</li>
      <li><strong>Email (only if you opt in):</strong> if you subscribe to our newsletter or download a free worksheet, we store your email address (and, if you provide it, your first name) until you unsubscribe. The list is processed on our behalf by Kit (formerly ConvertKit); every email includes a one-click unsubscribe link.</li>
      <li><strong>Calculator inputs:</strong> processed locally in your browser. State and financial selections are never transmitted to our servers.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Information we do not collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Accounts, passwords, or identity documents</li>
      <li>Precise geolocation</li>
      <li>Anything about your marriage, finances, or legal situation</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Cookies and third parties</h2>
    <p>
      We set no advertising cookies on our own. Our signup forms are processed by Kit, a third-party email
      service; third-party sites you reach through affiliate links (e.g., online prenup services) have their
      own privacy policies, which we encourage you to read. Full details — including how to control your
      choices — live in our <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on where you live — CCPA for California residents, GDPR for EU/UK visitors, or the LGPD
      (<em>Lei Geral de Proteção de Dados</em>, art. 18, for residents of Brazil) — you may request access to,
      correction of, or deletion of any data we hold about you, and information about how your data is processed.
      Email hello@prenupanswers.com and we'll comply within 30 days.
    </p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We'll update this page and change the date above whenever practices change.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
